    "sentences": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "0:00–0:04 — Hook (talking head, tight crop) “ChatGPT doesn’t just answer anymore.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "It ships the interface.”",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Cut on the word “interface” to the bill-splitter appearing mid-reply.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "0:04–0:14 — Proof (screen recording) Voiceover: “Ask it to split a bill and it doesn’t describe a calculator.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "It builds one.",
        "takes": [
          {
            "first_word": 55,
            "last_word": 56,
            "score": 86.95652173913044,
            "chosen": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Tip, headcount, total — live, inside the message.”",
        "takes": [
          {
            "first_word": 57,
            "last_word": 64,
            "score": 86.0,
            "chosen": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Show your finger changing the tip from 15 to 20 and the per-person number updating.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "No pause longer than a second.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "0:14–0:28 — What it actually is (talking head + simple animation) “OpenAI calls it Intelligent UI.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "GPT-6 picks from a library of native components — buttons, forms, charts — and a compiler streams them in as the tokens arrive.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Same bubble.",
        "takes": [
          {
            "first_word": 127,
            "last_word": 128,
            "score": 100.0,
            "chosen": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "No iframe.",
        "takes": [
          {
            "first_word": 133,
            "last_word": 133,
            "score": 80.0,
            "chosen": false
          },
          {
            "first_word": 145,
            "last_word": 145,
            "score": 80.0,
            "chosen": false
          },
          {
            "first_word": 164,
            "last_word": 164,
            "score": 80.0,
            "chosen": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "No ‘open this link.’”",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Animation: three boxes sliding in left to right — “tokens” → “component library” → “compiled bubble” — with a thin stream of dots moving between them.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 14,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Hold it under four seconds.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 15,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "0:28–0:48 — Second example (screen recording, quick cuts) Voiceover: “Same trick on anything visual.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 16,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Pricing, architecture, a recipe that rescales.”",
        "takes": [
          {
            "first_word": 209,
            "last_word": 215,
            "score": 81.3953488372093,
            "chosen": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Cut 1: the pricing chart with the under/over-100k toggle.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 18,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Tap it once.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 19,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Cut 2: the diagram with tappable nodes.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 20,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Tap “compiler.” “Developers have been hand-building these widgets for years.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 21,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "The model is now emitting them.”",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 22,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "0:48–1:05 — Why it matters (talking head) “The chat transcript is becoming the app surface.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 23,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "If your product is a conversation, the message itself can now hold state, inputs, and actions — not just text that points somewhere else.”",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 24,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Optional one-frame lower-third: “Chat tab only · Sol on paid · Luna on free.”",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 25,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "1:05–1:18 — Subtle Stream beat (talking head, same energy) “That’s the part I keep thinking about at Stream.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 26,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "We already treat the message as the unit that has to stay realtime, ordered, and multiplayer.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 27,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Generative UI just raises the stakes on that pipe — the bubble has to arrive, update, and stay in sync for everyone in the channel.”",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 28,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Do not show a logo.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 29,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Do not say “check out” or “sign up.”",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 30,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "1:18–1:32 — Close (screen recording into talking head) Back to the bill splitter for one second, then you: “So the next interface your users touch might not be a screen you designed.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 31,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "It might be a reply.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 32,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "Build like that’s normal.”",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 33,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "End card, 1.5 seconds: plain text “GPT-6 Intelligent UI · Chat tab” and your handle.",
        "takes": []
      },
      {
        "id": 34,
        "chapter": "c01",
        "text": "No CTA button.",
        "takes": []
      }
